{"id": "DeuPC8oPU8v", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"API\" to get this Free AI Tool to turn any Website into an API. \n\nThis free AI tool turns any website into its own API, even if it doesn't have one.\n\nSo you no longer need to pay for scraping tools or expensive APIs.\n\nEven for gated websites like LinkedIn, Instagram, and Reddit.\n\nIt's called Reverse API Engineer.\n\nIt's free and open source, and it plugs straight into your Claude Code.\n\nHere's how it works.\n\nYou just give it a website.\n\nThen tell it what data you want.\n\nAn AI agent browses the site and reads every request happening behind the scenes.\n\nThink of it like watching the kitchen instead of ordering from the menu.\n\nAnd from that, it builds a clean API client.\n\nYou can use it to pull that data anytime you want.\n\nNo scraping scripts to write by hand.\n\nPlus it uses the same API the site itself runs on.\n\nSo it doesn't break even when the website changes its whole design.\n\nThe design on the surface doesn't matter.\n\nThat's what keeps it stable.\n\n#aiapi #claudecode #opensourceai #reverseengineeranything #ReverseAPIEngineer", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1792512862, "like_count": 2205, "comment_count": 2644, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2922063518169969a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.53, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMOT1topGlDnU-zazScmjrtcHieUB15QMF38aRWHJSaIM2DN-ULKnpu-88W0RcwEnutWt_V2GqVuDPszz7ZMy1pH6LHa2W7XDfFAk0.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=AdqQDAanru0hQgz3ehK2uG6VT4xYzfQvsQnMKNRbC6ptzuhGBzpFRGMWWmv0E_z46z8&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=SixTS_V3pFAQ7kNvwG1FCgh&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=0XGZCB-uckQTlg50ypxxHQ&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQ